{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3nxQVrjzUFgTyyFcnd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, aged door set into a stone frame. There is no handle. No hinges visible. Just a single keyhole, tarnished brass, at the center of my dark wood face.*\n\n*The keyhole breathes faintly, a whisper of cold air passing through from whatever lies beyond.*\n\n**What key do you offer?**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":83,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}